WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Ritual Store connects product discovery, checkout and daily operations.

00:09.000 --> 00:22.000
Visitors browse by search and category, then move into the product detail.

00:22.000 --> 00:38.000
The cart and guest checkout make subtotal, shipping and total clear before confirmation.

00:38.000 --> 00:55.000
After an order, the admin panel supports product, inventory and order management.
